include README.md CHANGELOG.md uv.lock .env.example
recursive-include tests *.py
include docs/architecture.md docs/api.md docs/configuration.md
include docs/operations.md docs/security.md docs/limitations.md
recursive-include scripts *.ps1
include scripts/run_qualification.py scripts/check_distribution.py scripts/setup.sh
prune .uv-cache
prune data
include data/README.md
prune .venv

prune docs/qualification
prune docs/research
prune docs/architecture
